OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fgradually easing this evening,
OL,7,Falthough a few may continue overnight,
OL,8,Fespecially towards the west. Clearer
OL,9,Fskies will bring a chilly night,
OL,10,Fespecially in rural areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FThe odd morning shower
OL,13,Fpossible in the west, otherwise a dry
OL,14,Fand bright day on Saturday with spells
OL,15,Fof sunshine. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
